     1672        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
     1673        SIZE 9 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
     1674   DEFINE VARIABLE wt-cart AS DECIMAL FORMAT ">>,>>9.9<<":U INITIAL ?
     1675        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
     1676        SIZE 9 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
     1677   DEFINE IMAGE l-alpha1
     1678        FILENAME "adeicon\lock":U
