     2324       assign
     2325       n-gds-name:fgcolor = 15
     2326       gds-name = ""
     2327       l-gds-name:visible = true.
     2328       display gds-name with frame u-gds-form.
     2329       disable gds-name with frame u-gds-form.
     2330   END.
     2331   ON RIGHT-MOUSE-CLICK OF increase-pc IN FRAME u-gds-form
